OL,3,AFarage says Reform UK has 'taken no
OL,4,Aillegal money' after undercover report
OL,5,Aon donations
OL,6,
OL,7,FNigel Farage says Reform UK has "done
OL,8,Fnothing wrong" and "taken no illegal
OL,9,Fmoney" following the release of a
OL,10,FChannel 4 News report
OL,12,FSpeaking to reporters at the party's
OL,13,Fannual conference, he says Reform takes
OL,14,Fcompliance "very seriously" but must
OL,15,F"do better as we professionalise"
OL,17,FUndercover filming by Verbatim
OL,18,FInvestigations, aired on Thursday,
OL,19,Fshows Farage's senior aide Dan Jukes
OL,20,Fsuggesting a way to get around
OL,21,Felectoral law to secure a foreign
OL,22,Fdonation of #500,000 for Reform
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
